42	 * sandbox is present OR the explicit unsandboxed opt-in is set. Neither real
43	 * sandbox can run a *fixture* binary: bwrap (Linux) binds only /usr, /bin, /lib
44	 * and /nix from the host, so a fake CLI in a temp dir does not exist inside the
45	 * namespace, and sandbox-exec is macOS-only. Naming sandbox-exec via
46	 * LOBU_EXEC_SANDBOX on Linux is a hard error by design, which is exactly how
47	 * these tests used to break CI.
